WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.805
"Zann! Stop!"

2
00:00:01.806 --> 00:00:05.674
A sudden blast of energy grabbed Zann's body, flinging him back.

3
00:00:05.675 --> 00:00:09.428
He landed hard on the ground, several yards from the wormhole.

4
00:00:09.429 --> 00:00:12.501
When he looked up, the wormhole was spinning shut.

5
00:00:12.502 --> 00:00:18.266
A moment later Boz was hauling him up by the arm. The old man's face was livid.

6
00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:26.608
"What were you thinking?" Boz shouted, his long nose quivering with rage. "Have you gone mad, boy?"

7
00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:30.361
"How did you—" Zann didn't get a chance to finish the question.

8
00:00:30.362 --> 00:00:33.734
Boz snapped his fingers and zapped them both away.

9
00:00:33.735 --> 00:00:41.185
They landed in Teplo's living room. "You got him in time!" Gliss cried. "Thank goodness!"

10
00:00:41.186 --> 00:00:45.691
Zann ducked as Zing flew at him, blasting him with angry flames.

11
00:00:45.692 --> 00:00:54.283
"Quit it," Zann muttered. Glancing around, he saw Perda, Darb, and Teplo staring at him. "What's going on?"

12
00:00:54.284 --> 00:00:57.829
"Zing woke up and realized you were gone," Darb said.

13
00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.384
"He freaked out and rushed to find me."

14
00:01:00.385 --> 00:01:05.104
Zann scowled at the dragon. Then he realized what Darb had said.

15
00:01:05.105 --> 00:01:11.241
"Wait," said Zann. "What do you mean, he rushed to find you? You were in the same room."

16
00:01:11.242 --> 00:01:18.408
"Not exactly." Darb's face went red. "Um, I promised Gliss I'd meet her after midnight.

17
00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:22.244
I guess I didn't notice you were gone when I woke up and sneaked out."

18
00:01:22.245 --> 00:01:25.298
Zann looked at Gliss. She was blushing too.

19
00:01:25.299 --> 00:01:31.361
"I had something important to tell him," she said. "I'm leaving First City tomorrow."

20
00:01:31.362 --> 00:01:35.449
Zann just shrugged, thinking of what he'd overheard earlier. He

21
00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:39.709
wasn't surprised that Gliss was leaving for Swamp Bottom tomorrow too. Her

22
00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:43.657
parents and her uncle had been involved in the same meetings as Boz. "Whatever

23
00:01:43.658 --> 00:01:46.711
you say," he said with a smirk. "I

24
00:01:46.712 --> 00:01:53.324
think Darb would have figured out you'd left First City when he saw you in Swamp Bottom tomorrow with the rest of us." "Huh?"

25
00:01:53.325 --> 00:01:57.432
Darb looked confused. "No, you don't understand. Gliss

26
00:01:57.433 --> 00:01:59.971
isn't going back to Swamp Bottom. She's

27
00:01:59.972 --> 00:02:03.717
going on an expedition to the Cave of the Unknown." "What?"

28
00:02:03.718 --> 00:02:09.457
Zann whirled toward Gliss. "The Cave of the Unknown," he repeated. "Are

29
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:12.966
you serious? Why are you going there?" The

30
00:02:12.967 --> 00:02:16.647
Cave of the Unknown was a remote and dangerous place. Few

31
00:02:16.648 --> 00:02:21.329
people had seen it, and even fewer had survived to describe it. Zann's

32
00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:29.224
parents were among those few. They had visited the Cave a couple of times, returning with many frightening stories about it. Staring

33
00:02:29.225 --> 00:02:34.682
at the floor, Gliss shrugged. "My parents are making me go." Zann

34
00:02:34.683 --> 00:02:40.299
hardly heard her. He was still thinking about all the stories he'd heard during his childhood. "My

35
00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:48.853
parents said the Cave of the Unknown is huge and really spooky, with countless tunnels and chambers," he said. "The

36
00:02:48.854 --> 00:02:54.932
whole place is littered with ancient relics and manuscripts from the Old Times and stuff." "Yeah.

37
00:02:54.933 --> 00:03:01.406
Like the relics and texts Morb used to try to take over Magica," Perda said with a shudder. "Exactly.

38
00:03:01.407 --> 00:03:08.226
That's why the Red Council decided it's time to seal the place off," Teplo put in. "Until

39
00:03:08.227 --> 00:03:13.266
now they've relied on the Cave's reputation to keep people away. But

40
00:03:13.267 --> 00:03:20.219
after Morb's recent adventures, they don't want anyone else coming along and trying the same thing. The

41
00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:25.323
Council is sending an expedition to seal it off so the relics can't be removed." Boz

42
00:03:25.324 --> 00:03:28.759
didn't seem to be paying much attention to the conversation. His

43
00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:33.044
nose quivering wildly, he was still glaring at Zann. Zann

44
