recognized that look. It meant his grandfather was thinking hard. He

45
00:03:38.003 --> 00:03:42.857
was probably trying to come up with the perfect way to punish Zann for sneaking out tonight. Boz

46
00:03:42.858 --> 00:03:46.989
spoke out at last. "Enough about the expedition. We

47
00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:51.072
were discussing Zann's outrageous behavior." Zann

48
00:03:51.073 --> 00:03:54.087
cringed. Then he looked over at Darb. "So

49
00:03:54.088 --> 00:03:58.766
you saw I was missing and ran to tell Boz?" he asked. "I

50
00:03:58.767 --> 00:04:02.495
never thought you were the type to tell on your friends." "That's

51
00:04:02.496 --> 00:04:05.666
not what happened," Gliss said. "When

52
00:04:05.667 --> 00:04:09.991
Darb and I realized you were missing, we checked with Perda. She

53
00:04:09.992 --> 00:04:16.738
didn't know where you were, but she tried all your passwords and was eventually able to make your note appear." "I

54
00:04:16.739 --> 00:04:21.336
can't believe you didn't tell me you were going, Zann," Perda added. Her

55
00:04:21.337 --> 00:04:25.839
eyes flashed with anger, and her voice was cool and unfriendly. Zann

56
00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.644
hated having her look at him that way. He

57
00:04:28.645 --> 00:04:33.692
wished he could make her understand why he’d tried to go through the wormhole without telling his friends. But he

58
00:04:33.693 --> 00:04:36.145
wasn't sure how to communicate that. "Gliss came

59
00:04:36.146 --> 00:04:40.401
to us right away, thank goodness," Teplo said. "Since we

60
00:04:40.402 --> 00:04:47.122
knew you wouldn't be able to reach the palace wormhole, Boz guessed you might try the one in Wormwood." Zann glared

61
00:04:47.123 --> 00:04:52.898
at Gliss. " You ratted me out? I thought we were friends!" "We

62
00:04:52.899 --> 00:04:58.203
are," Gliss said, looking hurt. "I was trying to help you." "

63
00:04:58.204 --> 00:05:02.445
Help me?" Zann gritted his teeth, furious.

64
00:05:02.446 --> 00:05:06.384
