72
00:05:38.387 --> 00:05:46.197
"We are," Zann said. "I heard you two talking about it earlier. You said we leave tomorrow afternoon."

73
00:05:46.198 --> 00:05:50.544
"Yes, we do," Teplo said. "But not for Swamp Bottom.

74
00:05:50.545 --> 00:05:54.839
Your grandfather and I are part of the expedition Gliss mentioned.

75
00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:57.158
That means you're part of it too."

76
00:05:57.159 --> 00:06:07.062
Boz nodded. "That's right, Zann. You're going to the Cave of the Unknown."

